  "triples": [
    {
      "subject": "Fyodor Pavlovitch",
      "relation": "FATHER_OF",
      "object": "Ivan",
      "quote": "Receiving this amiable greeting, he stood still in silence and with an ironical air watched his son going upstairs, till he passed out of sight.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 38,
      "doc_id": "ch038",
      "label_ko": "5편 7장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Smerdyakov",
      "relation": "SERVANT_OF",
      "object": "Fyodor Pavlovitch",
      "quote": "“What’s the matter with him?” he promptly asked Smerdyakov, who had followed Ivan. “Angry about something. Who can tell?” the valet muttered evasively.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 38,
      "doc_id": "ch038",
      "label_ko": "5편 7장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Ivan",
      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Alyosha",
      "quote": "He even hated Alyosha, recalling the conversation he had just had with him.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 38,
      "doc_id": "ch038",
      "label_ko": "5편 7장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Smerdyakov",
      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Ivan",
      "quote": "except perhaps that he loathed the valet as one who had insulted him more gravely than any one in the world.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 38,
      "doc_id": "ch038",
      "label_ko": "5편 7장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov",
      "relation": "FATHER_OF",
      "object": "Ivan",
      "quote": "Go to my father’s, to Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov, and tell him I haven’t gone to Tchermashnya.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 38,
      "doc_id": "ch038",
      "label_ko": "5편 7장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Marfa Ignatyevna",
      "relation": "SERVANT_OF",
      "object": "Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov",
      "quote": "To her master’s bitter, though deserved, reproaches, Marfa Ignatyevna replied that the fowl was a very old one to begin with",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 38,
      "doc_id": "ch038",
      "label_ko": "5편 7장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov",
      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Marfa Ignatyevna",
      "quote": "To her master’s bitter, though deserved, reproaches, Marfa Ignatyevna replied that the fowl was a very old one to begin with, and that she had never been trained as a cook.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 38,
      "doc_id": "ch038",
      "label_ko": "5편 7장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Smerdyakov",
      "relation": "PRESENT_AT",
      "object": "Smerdyakov's epileptic fit",
      "quote": "They found him at the bottom of the cellar steps, writhing in convulsions and foaming at the mouth.",
